        "markdown": "# Bride Of Charlie: A Wrinkle In Time | Episode 1\n\nCandace Owens introduces the series and examines public accounts of Erika Kirk’s upbringing and family history, including the school associated with her childhood. The graph records the episode’s framing and does not independently adopt its allegations.\n\nThis graph is an attributed map of the published episode, not an independent endorsement of its claims."
